357
00:17:08,370 --> 00:17:10,840
Now, if you'll excuse me, I have work to do.

358
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:12,090
Yeah, you do.

359
00:17:12,090 --> 00:17:13,780
You dog, you.

360
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:21,860
Did you get that?

361
